        <div>
          <div class="section-subtitle">Heavy-Duty Job Site Support</div>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">Construction & Demolition Debris Containers Built Tough</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Roofing tear-offs, drywall demolition, framing scrap, and masonry teardowns require serious roll-off containers. Dumpsters Now supplies heavy-gauge steel dumpsters that can take a beating on active work sites.
          </p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 25px 0;">
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy-dark);"><span style="color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem;">✓</span> Engineered for heavy C&D waste including roofing shingles, drywall & lumber</li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy-dark);"><span style="color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem;">✓</span> Low-profile sidewalls on 15 & 20-yard bins for easy side manual loading</li>
            <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy-dark);"><span style="color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem;">✓</span> Same-day dispatch to keep framing, roofing & demo crews working without delay</li>
          </ul>
